c of the two arguments. The other prec is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adjusted to match before doing the addition.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The nbits is the larger nbits of the two arguments after adjusting for prec.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If either argument is signed, the output is signed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The crry and ovflw are set if there is a carry or an overflow.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The default for States.addMode is .overflow and allows for overflows.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If States.addMode = .saturate, then in the case of overflow, the values","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stored are the maximum or minimum possible values.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/twoscmplt\/+=(_:_:)-5qql"}}}